<div class="translator-summary">

<div class="ts-header">
  <h2>✦ Translator's Summary ✦</h2>
  <div class="ts-subtitle">Overview &amp; Diagram — from the translator, not the original text</div>
</div>

<div class="ts-insight">
  <div class="ts-insight-label">Core Principle</div>
  <div class="ts-insight-text">
    The rooster's call = the Torah's cry = <em>Gevuros</em> transformed into <em>Da'as</em>.<br><br>
    Night = concealment = <em>dinim</em> = <em>Malchus</em> in exile = sleep (1/60 of death).<br>
    At <em>Chatzos</em>: <em>Binah</em> illuminates the <em>Gevuros</em> → they are sweetened →<br>
    the very concealment becomes <em>Da'as</em> → the rooster cries: <em>"Awaken!"</em><br><br>
    "<em>HaNosein laSechvi <strong>Vinah</strong></em>" — <em>Binah</em> specifically:<br>
    from there the <em>dinim</em> arise, and through her they are sweetened.
  </div>
</div>

<div style="margin:36px 0;">
